        <td><span data-field="chemical_unsubtlable_6">{{ chemical_unsubtlable_6 }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="chemical_not_tested_6">{{ chemical_not_tested_6 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p style="font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 20px;">The information above is given as a guide only and is based on published technical data and experience. The chemical resistance of the above products is dependent on factors such as chemical exposure, concentration of the chemical and temperature. The above chemicals are valid for a temperature of 23°C. Use of the above table is at the user's own discretion and risk. Those using it must satisfy themselves that their application presents no health and safety risks. The end user should assess compatibility with their application and contact Thomas & Bets for further information.</p>
</div>

